236
00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:03.590
Kinasusuklaman kita at ginawa kitang malungkot.

237
00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:06.990
pasensya na po.

238
00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:17.000
Bakit wala kang sinabi? Bakit?

239
00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:22.440
Bakit hinayaan mo lang akong galitin ka? Bakit? bakit...

240
00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:31.950
pasensya na po.

241
00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:37.350
I'm so sorry.

